### 推论 29.2（对数径向缺陷与镜像反号）

定义

\[
\boxed{
\beta_\rho
=
\log|c_\rho|
=
\frac12
\log
\frac{|\rho-1|^2}{|\rho|^2}.
}
\]

则

\[
\boxed{
\mathrm{RH}
\iff
\beta_\rho=0
\quad
\text{对全部 }\rho.
}
\]

对函数方程镜像

\[
\rho^\sharp=1-\overline\rho
\]

有

\[
\boxed{
|c_{\rho^\sharp}|=|c_\rho|^{-1},
\qquad
\beta_{\rho^\sharp}=-\beta_\rho.
}
\]

